{"name":"分页","description":"分页是把大量结果分成多个可定位页面浏览的导航组件 · 订单列表可每页显示 20 条并让用户跳到第 5 页。应显示当前页和总量并同步到网址；连续浏览的信息流可考虑加载更多。","quote":"内容太多一页放不下，底下加上 1、2、3 翻页。","agentPrompt":"请给审计日志增加分页，把页码和筛选条件同步到网址。切页时保留筛选，刷新、返回和复制链接后都能恢复同一结果。请验证第一页、中间页、最后一页以及没有结果的情况。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-pagination\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>分页<span>Pagination</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">内容太多一页放不下，底下加上 1、2、3 翻页。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">分页是把大量结果分成多个可定位页面浏览的导航组件</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>订单列表可每页显示 20 条并让用户跳到第 5 页。应显示当前页和总量并同步到网址；连续浏览的信息流可考虑加载更多。</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"pg-live\">\n    <input type=\"radio\" name=\"pgl\" id=\"pg-p1\" checked>\n    <input type=\"radio\" name=\"pgl\" id=\"pg-p2\">\n    <input type=\"radio\" name=\"pgl\" id=\"pg-p3\">\n    <div class=\"pg-ctl\">\n      <span class=\"pagination-item\">‹</span>\n      <label class=\"pagination-item\" for=\"pg-p1\">1</label>\n      <label class=\"pagination-item\" for=\"pg-p2\">2</label>\n      <label class=\"pagination-item\" for=\"pg-p3\">3</label>\n      <span class=\"pagination-ellipsis\">…</span>\n      <span class=\"pagination-item\">10</span>\n      <span class=\"pagination-item\">›</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pg-panes\">\n      <div class=\"pg-pane pg-pane-1\"><i style=\"width:92%\"></i><i style=\"width:68%\"></i><i style=\"width:84%\"></i></div>\n      <div class=\"pg-pane pg-pane-2\"><i style=\"width:76%\"></i><i style=\"width:95%\"></i><i style=\"width:60%\"></i></div>\n      <div class=\"pg-pane pg-pane-3\"><i style=\"width:88%\"></i><i style=\"width:64%\"></i><i style=\"width:79%\"></i></div>\n    </div>\n  </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"les